WEBVTT

00:02.168 --> 00:04.337
Scat!

00:04.587 --> 00:06.673
Draw your sword and fight.

00:06.881 --> 00:08.800
You coward!

00:15.140 --> 00:16.516
Whatever.

00:16.808 --> 00:20.520
I'll pierce you and the box together.

00:24.607 --> 00:25.567
Stop it!

00:27.068 --> 00:31.448
Stop it!

02:07.877 --> 02:10.463
Stop it!

02:22.809 --> 02:24.853
You cracked his ribs!

02:25.520 --> 02:27.856
Aren't you a member of Demon Slayer Corps?

02:28.314 --> 02:31.401
Don't you understand
why Zenitsu won't draw his sword?

02:32.360 --> 02:36.364
Drawing swords against other members
is a big taboo.

02:37.198 --> 02:40.326
You ignored the taboo
and hurt him one-sidedly.

02:40.702 --> 02:41.995
Is it fun for you?

02:42.662 --> 02:45.331
You're really the utmost despicable!

02:54.966 --> 02:56.759
So that's the case.

02:56.968 --> 02:58.469
I'm very sorry.

03:00.054 --> 03:02.932
Why don't we have a fistfight then?

03:03.057 --> 03:05.727
No, I think you completely
misunderstood me.

03:05.894 --> 03:06.853
First of all--

03:09.230 --> 03:11.274
Members can't fight among themselves.

03:13.067 --> 03:14.986
I'm not saying that barehanded is fine.

03:15.278 --> 03:16.654
Listen to me!

03:29.000 --> 03:31.628
That guy moves so flexibly.

03:31.920 --> 03:34.672
Tanjiro already broke his ribs.

03:49.771 --> 03:54.234
In fact, didn't Tanjiro himself
already commit the taboo?

03:54.567 --> 03:55.777
Since he broke his ribs.

04:14.087 --> 04:15.880
This guy...

04:19.300 --> 04:21.427
He attacks bizarrely low.

04:21.886 --> 04:23.346
It's like I'm...

04:23.638 --> 04:24.889
This is like...

04:25.932 --> 04:28.226
fighting with a four-legged beast.

04:30.687 --> 04:31.980
To lower my attacks,

04:32.063 --> 04:34.732
I must stay lower than my opponent.

04:40.697 --> 04:42.865
This kind of soft joints

04:43.491 --> 04:45.201
already surpass ordinary people.

04:48.288 --> 04:50.123
I'm amazing, right?

04:50.331 --> 04:52.709
I'm amazing, right?

04:53.084 --> 04:54.877
He said it twice in a row.

04:55.211 --> 04:56.713
Blowing one's own horn.

04:57.297 --> 05:00.508
I can do this too.

05:06.514 --> 05:08.349
Please stop it.

05:08.474 --> 05:10.560
Don't do that when you're injured.

05:10.643 --> 05:12.020
It will get worse.

05:12.895 --> 05:15.481
That's great.

05:15.565 --> 05:19.527
Nothing compares to the momentary pleasure
I feel when my injury worsens.

05:19.694 --> 05:22.447
At least, think about your future.

05:23.197 --> 05:24.282
I don't care.

05:26.993 --> 05:32.457
Please calm down.

05:33.833 --> 05:34.792
That sound!

05:34.876 --> 05:36.544
Did he crack open his head?

05:50.516 --> 05:51.434
A girl?

05:52.935 --> 05:54.187
His face...

05:55.229 --> 05:56.939
What about it?

05:59.150 --> 06:01.986
Do you have an opinion about my face?

06:04.322 --> 06:06.365
He makes me feel uncomfortable.

06:06.574 --> 06:10.369
His body is buffed,
but he has a feminine face.

06:11.037 --> 06:14.540
Why are you staring at my face?

06:14.916 --> 06:16.334
I didn't.

06:16.501 --> 06:18.336
I wasn't looking at you.

06:20.296 --> 06:22.215
I have nothing to say about your face.

06:22.632 --> 06:23.966
Refined and small.

06:24.050 --> 06:26.177
A fair complexion. I think it's great.

06:26.302 --> 06:27.678
I'm going to kill you!

06:27.762 --> 06:28.763
Come at me.

06:28.846 --> 06:29.764
No way.

06:29.847 --> 06:31.265
I won't attack you again.

06:31.474 --> 06:33.351
Headbutt me again.

06:33.476 --> 06:34.477
I won't do that!

06:34.560 --> 06:36.312
Do it. Hurry up!

06:36.395 --> 06:37.939
You better sit down.

06:38.022 --> 06:39.107
Are you okay?

06:39.315 --> 06:41.025
Wide forehead.

06:41.109 --> 06:43.027
I'll tell you my name.

06:43.528 --> 06:45.363
I'm Inosuke Hashibira.

06:45.696 --> 06:46.989
You better remember me.

06:47.073 --> 06:48.449
How do you write it?

06:48.908 --> 06:50.368
Write?

06:50.785 --> 06:53.371
I can't read or write.

06:53.830 --> 06:56.290
But my name is written on my loincloth.

06:59.335 --> 07:00.378
What's wrong?

07:00.795 --> 07:02.130
He stopped moving.

07:05.049 --> 07:06.300
What's wrong with you?

07:18.771 --> 07:20.731
He collapsed!

07:20.940 --> 07:22.900
Is he dead?

07:23.317 --> 07:24.444
No.

07:24.694 --> 07:26.571
He probably has a concussion

07:27.321 --> 07:29.824
because I headbutted him so hard.

07:30.408 --> 07:32.368
Are you okay, Tanjiro?

07:33.619 --> 07:34.871
You're amazing.

07:34.954 --> 07:36.497
May I touch your head?

07:36.581 --> 07:37.582
Sure.

07:38.291 --> 07:39.876
How terrifying.

07:40.251 --> 07:42.587
Tanjiro's head isn't bleeding at all.

07:42.753 --> 07:44.547
How hard is his head?

07:45.381 --> 07:47.717
Even that boar was knocked unconscious.

07:48.634 --> 07:51.012
Your head is so hard.

07:51.971 --> 07:53.264
Is that so?

08:13.534 --> 08:14.619
He's awake!

08:14.702 --> 08:17.121
Let's fight!

08:17.330 --> 08:19.040
-He's like that after waking up!
-Hey!

08:19.123 --> 08:21.125
-This kind of person is the scariest!
-Let's fight!

08:31.010 --> 08:33.012
What are you guys doing?

08:33.679 --> 08:35.056
We're burying bodies.

08:37.683 --> 08:39.227
Come help us, Inosuke.

08:39.602 --> 08:42.688
There are more dead people
inside the house.

08:43.397 --> 08:46.776
What's the meaning of burying a corpse?

08:47.276 --> 08:48.361
I won't do it!

08:48.444 --> 08:49.654
I won't help!

08:49.820 --> 08:52.240
Leave it. Come and fight with me!

08:53.533 --> 08:55.451
This guy is really odd.

08:55.701 --> 08:57.370
He's asking the meaning of this.

08:59.288 --> 09:00.414
I see.

09:01.415 --> 09:03.709
You can't help
because you're seriously injured.

09:07.296 --> 09:08.881
These two guys are doomed.

09:09.131 --> 09:10.800
None of them are normal.

09:11.259 --> 09:12.802
No, it's okay.

09:13.094 --> 09:16.180
Everyone's pain tolerance
is different after all.

09:16.722 --> 09:19.350
Moving the dead people outside,

09:19.433 --> 09:22.770
digging, and burying them
can be really tiring.

09:23.271 --> 09:25.481
I'll work hard
with Zenitsu and the children.

09:25.565 --> 09:26.649
Don't worry.

09:27.733 --> 09:28.901
He will misunderstand.

09:29.735 --> 09:30.987
He will misunderstand.

09:32.738 --> 09:34.699
Rest well, Inosuke.

09:36.701 --> 09:38.619
Sorry for forcing you when you're injured.

09:40.246 --> 09:41.956
Don't look down on me!

09:42.039 --> 09:45.084
Be it 100 or 200 people.
Watch me as I bury them!

09:45.334 --> 09:48.170
I'm better at burying bodies
than anyone else!

10:01.726 --> 10:03.728
What's the guy doing?

10:03.811 --> 10:05.104
Don't look at him.

10:12.903 --> 10:16.365
Get down the mountain.

10:18.451 --> 10:20.119
The crow is actually talking.

10:20.578 --> 10:22.496
You two, don't overthink.

10:23.956 --> 10:27.960
All right, follow me now.

10:36.052 --> 10:38.137
Hey, where are you going?

10:38.512 --> 10:40.056
I'm going down the mountain.

10:40.431 --> 10:42.475
We're not done with our duel!

10:42.683 --> 10:44.143
You must be tired, right?

10:44.393 --> 10:45.853
Okay, go down the mountain.

10:47.188 --> 10:48.856
I'm not tired at all!

10:50.191 --> 10:51.651
Let's fight!

10:57.406 --> 11:00.451
No, don't!

11:00.576 --> 11:03.663
Don't leave, Shoichi!

11:03.829 --> 11:05.247
Shoichi is very strong!

11:05.331 --> 11:08.584
I need Shoichi to protect me.

11:08.793 --> 11:11.253
Shoichi doesn't want
to protect you at all!

11:11.337 --> 11:13.422
Don't leave me alone!

11:13.506 --> 11:14.840
Control yourself!

11:21.305 --> 11:22.556
Give me your hand.

11:26.727 --> 11:28.437
It's to ward off demons.

11:28.771 --> 11:32.108
Someone with rare blood like you
should always carry it.

11:32.775 --> 11:34.443
It's the fragrance of wisteria.

11:35.069 --> 11:36.237
Wisteria?

11:36.529 --> 11:38.406
Demons fear this kind of flower.

11:38.656 --> 11:40.032
You better carry it.

11:40.199 --> 11:43.828
Ward off demons.

11:46.747 --> 11:49.250
Thank you very much.

11:49.583 --> 11:51.710
We can go home by ourselves.

11:52.586 --> 11:53.796
Have a safe journey.

11:56.298 --> 12:01.345
All right, follow me now.

12:07.726 --> 12:09.145
Let's fight!

12:09.395 --> 12:12.606
I'll find your weakness and beat you.

12:12.773 --> 12:14.400
I have a name!

12:14.483 --> 12:16.068
I'm Tanjiro Kamado!

12:16.569 --> 12:18.696
Gonpachiro Kamaboko.

12:18.863 --> 12:20.322
I'll beat you.

12:20.656 --> 12:22.992
-Who do you mean?
-You!

12:23.075 --> 12:24.201
You got the wrong person!

12:24.910 --> 12:26.412
You guys are so noisy!

12:32.418 --> 12:34.545
WISTERIA

12:36.255 --> 12:38.048
It's the wisteria family crest.

12:40.551 --> 12:43.345
Have a rest.

12:43.804 --> 12:47.683
Anyone who's injured,
rest until you recover fully.

12:48.684 --> 12:50.060
Can I rest now?

12:50.686 --> 12:54.106
Although I fought with a demon
when I was still injured this time.

12:54.857 --> 12:56.192
Cough.

12:56.442 --> 12:58.402
Cough? What do you mean?

12:58.569 --> 13:00.154
I'm going to eat it.

13:04.200 --> 13:05.284
Hello.

13:06.785 --> 13:08.871
Sorry for disturbing you
at this late hour.

13:09.038 --> 13:10.956
Monster!

13:11.040 --> 13:11.957
Cut it out!

13:12.166 --> 13:13.751
Who the heck are you?

13:15.252 --> 13:18.005
You guys are demon slayers, right?

13:18.422 --> 13:19.882
She looks weak.

13:20.049 --> 13:21.175
Rude!

13:21.258 --> 13:22.510
Please come in.

13:29.016 --> 13:31.185
That granny walks really fast.

13:31.977 --> 13:33.854
Please follow me.

13:39.068 --> 13:41.403
Clean clothes for everyone.

13:43.656 --> 13:45.991
Food for everyone.

13:46.992 --> 13:48.536
She's a monster, Tanjiro!

13:48.619 --> 13:50.120
That granny is a monster!

13:50.204 --> 13:51.622
Her movement is oddly fast!

13:51.705 --> 13:52.706
She's a monster!

13:52.790 --> 13:54.083
Monster granny!

14:00.172 --> 14:01.966
Use chopsticks.

14:13.936 --> 14:17.398
Since you're so hungry,
you can eat this too.

14:20.359 --> 14:21.318
Here you go.

14:21.443 --> 14:22.987
This is wrong!

14:23.112 --> 14:26.949
This guy completely forgot about the box.

14:27.032 --> 14:30.202
Are you kidding me, stupid eyebrows?

14:35.332 --> 14:37.585
Your beds are ready.

14:38.085 --> 14:40.004
Monster granny appeared--

14:41.672 --> 14:43.257
First come, first serve.

14:43.340 --> 14:44.842
I'm going to sleep here.

14:45.593 --> 14:46.594
Sure.

14:46.760 --> 14:48.220
Sleep wherever you want.

14:49.597 --> 14:51.348
Zenitsu, where do you want to sleep?

14:56.770 --> 14:59.231
The doctor is here for your treatment.

14:59.398 --> 15:00.482
Hello, everyone.

15:01.400 --> 15:04.361
Yes.

15:06.113 --> 15:07.239
Serious injuries.

15:12.077 --> 15:15.372
The three of us have broken ribs.

15:15.623 --> 15:18.876
TWO RIBS, THREE RIBS, FOUR RIBS.

15:20.836 --> 15:23.631
Compared to my ribs,
the one on my head hurts more.

15:24.048 --> 15:25.132
I'm sorry.

15:25.215 --> 15:27.593
You need to apologize to me.

15:27.885 --> 15:29.261
It hurts so much.

15:29.595 --> 15:31.513
I was grabbed, kicked, and punched by you.

15:32.348 --> 15:33.390
Apologize now.

15:33.557 --> 15:34.642
No.

15:34.892 --> 15:36.852
-Apologize now!
-No!

15:36.936 --> 15:38.103
You should apologize!

15:39.021 --> 15:42.441
If not, we won't eat with you.

15:43.025 --> 15:45.027
What do you mean?

15:45.527 --> 15:48.739
A meal tastes better
when you eat with other people.

15:48.989 --> 15:50.115
He's right.

15:50.574 --> 15:52.534
Are you guys crazy?

15:52.618 --> 15:54.370
You don't have the right to say that!

15:55.037 --> 15:57.998
Do you need anything else?

15:58.290 --> 16:00.209
-Monster!
-Cut it out!

16:02.962 --> 16:03.921
WISTERIA

16:04.004 --> 16:05.881
Based on the Kasugai Crow's explanation,

16:05.965 --> 16:08.133
the family bearing
the wisteria family crest

16:08.425 --> 16:12.012
was once rescued by demon slayers.

16:12.513 --> 16:16.016
So, they offer hospitality
to demon slayers with all their heart.

16:16.558 --> 16:18.018
Although that's what I heard,

16:18.394 --> 16:20.646
I can't believe how well
we're being treated.

16:21.188 --> 16:23.565
What's Demon Slayer Corps?

16:24.108 --> 16:25.484
Since you asked, Inosuke,

16:25.567 --> 16:27.236
why did you join Demon Slayer Corps?

16:29.154 --> 16:31.323
There must be a reason, right?

16:32.908 --> 16:37.162
A member of Demon Slayer Corps
ran into my territory.

16:37.413 --> 16:40.457
We had a contest of strength
and I snatched his sword.

16:42.960 --> 16:45.379
That Demon Slayer Corps member
is so unlucky.

16:46.380 --> 16:49.967
After that, I heard
about the Final Selection

16:50.134 --> 16:52.469
and the existence of demons.

16:53.095 --> 16:55.806
That's why you joined Demon Slayer Corps.

16:56.140 --> 16:59.768
If that's the case, you grew up
on the mountain just like me.

17:00.227 --> 17:02.229
We are not the same.

17:02.396 --> 17:05.065
I don't have parents or siblings.

17:05.315 --> 17:10.988
Challenging other living creatures
to a fight is my only pleasure.

17:11.822 --> 17:14.783
I see.

17:22.750 --> 17:23.876
Tanjiro.

17:24.001 --> 17:26.336
Nobody asked you so I'll do it.

17:27.629 --> 17:30.674
Why are you carrying a demon with you?

17:40.267 --> 17:41.435
Zenitsu.

17:42.019 --> 17:44.396
You still treat me like a friend
although you knew it.

17:45.355 --> 17:47.441
You're really kind, Zenitsu.

17:48.233 --> 17:49.276
Thank you.

17:51.862 --> 17:54.281
I can't help it
if you compliment me like this.

17:57.242 --> 17:58.952
I have a keen nose.

17:59.369 --> 18:01.080
From the start, I already knew this.

18:01.789 --> 18:05.250
You're kind and very strong, Zenitsu.

18:05.918 --> 18:07.836
No, I'm not strong at all.

18:08.045 --> 18:09.129
Are you kidding me?

18:09.213 --> 18:11.673
You stopped me from bringing Shoichi.

18:11.757 --> 18:13.092
I haven't forgiven you.

18:19.973 --> 18:22.476
The demon is coming out!

18:22.559 --> 18:23.519
It's fine.

18:23.602 --> 18:26.230
What do you mean by that? Explain!

18:26.313 --> 18:27.314
Keep quiet.

18:27.397 --> 18:29.441
Zenitsu, it's middle of the night now.

18:30.901 --> 18:33.237
Why did he ignore my provocation?

18:33.487 --> 18:35.155
I even took his food away.

18:36.156 --> 18:40.077
Come to think of it, why did that guy
get angry multiple times?

18:42.121 --> 18:43.413
I forgot.

18:47.626 --> 18:49.628
Didn't you lock it?

18:49.711 --> 18:50.879
Keep quiet.

18:50.963 --> 18:52.548
Protect me!

18:52.631 --> 18:54.216
Protect me quickly!

18:54.299 --> 18:56.260
Inosuke is fine too!

18:56.343 --> 18:57.594
Don't come over here!

19:08.313 --> 19:09.940
It's coming out!

19:11.066 --> 19:11.942
I must hide.

19:12.025 --> 19:13.735
I'm going to get eaten.

19:19.116 --> 19:20.200
Nezuko.

19:40.804 --> 19:44.224
I used too much of my brain.

19:46.310 --> 19:48.687
Zenitsu, Nezuko is my--

19:48.770 --> 19:49.771
Tanjiro.

19:53.400 --> 19:54.526
You...

19:56.069 --> 19:57.154
Zenitsu?

19:59.281 --> 20:01.992
You...

20:03.994 --> 20:06.663
You're so lucky!

20:08.290 --> 20:11.335
You're carrying such a cute girl with you.

20:12.461 --> 20:15.172
Carrying such a cute girl,

20:15.255 --> 20:18.383
you traveled around the world
happily every day.

20:19.426 --> 20:21.053
No, Zenitsu.

20:21.136 --> 20:24.223
Give me back the blood I lost!

20:24.306 --> 20:26.141
I...

20:26.225 --> 20:31.021
I didn't go all out so that you can flirt
and have fun with a girl every day!

20:31.104 --> 20:35.817
Did I endure the kicks and punches
from that monster boar for this?

20:35.984 --> 20:37.569
Calm down, Zenitsu.

20:37.736 --> 20:39.112
Why did you change suddenly?

20:39.279 --> 20:44.534
The Demon Slayer Corps
is not a place to play and fool around!

20:44.618 --> 20:47.037
People like you ought to be purged!

20:47.120 --> 20:48.413
You'll be purged now.

20:48.664 --> 20:51.333
This reminds me, you committed
the crime of obstructing my marriage

20:51.416 --> 20:55.212
and the crime of letting Shoichi go home.

20:55.504 --> 20:57.381
I will purge you right now!

20:57.756 --> 21:01.635
Don't you mess around
with the Demon Slayer Corps!

21:01.802 --> 21:04.429
You! People like you!

21:05.555 --> 21:07.808
Zenitsu, stop it!

21:08.475 --> 21:10.686
How dare you underestimate
Demon Slayer Corps!

21:11.311 --> 21:15.899
Go to hell!

21:15.983 --> 21:19.027
I hate you!

22:54.915 --> 22:58.043
-Tales of Demon Slayer Academy.
-Tales of Demon Slayer Academy.

22:59.711 --> 23:01.755
A new semester is here.
Introduce yourself.

23:01.838 --> 23:02.714
Yes!

23:02.881 --> 23:04.049
I'm Tanjiro Kamado.

23:04.174 --> 23:06.468
My family owns a bakery.
I'm the eldest among six siblings.

23:06.551 --> 23:07.427
NO EARRINGS ALLOWED

23:07.511 --> 23:08.804
Take off your earrings.

23:09.179 --> 23:11.139
I'm Inosuke Hashibira.

23:11.223 --> 23:12.224
NO IMPROPER CLOTHING ALLOWED

23:12.307 --> 23:13.391
Button your shirt.

23:13.642 --> 23:15.852
I'm Agatsuma...

23:16.436 --> 23:17.854
Dye your hair back to black.

23:17.938 --> 23:19.106
But this is my natural--

23:19.189 --> 23:20.565
Don't talk back!

23:20.649 --> 23:21.608
He's unreasonable!

23:23.485 --> 23:25.195
No eating bread is allowed!

23:25.654 --> 23:28.323
Next, episode 15, "Mount Natagumo."

23:29.074 --> 23:30.200
Say no to agōgē!

23:30.283 --> 23:31.243
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
